| ShortSummary    = Sarge and his crew begin to gather supplies for their mission, hiding their truck using cloaking technology. They rob a jewelry store to gather [[Piezoelectricity|piezoelectric gems]], attracting the attention of S.H.I.E.L.D. May and [[Elena Rodriguez|Elena "Yo-Yo" Rodriguez]] lead a team to capture Sarge and his crew, but are locked out of the vault. On a hunch, May finds the hidden truck where Sarge's crew is using a portal to move the gems out of the vault. May overpowers [[Jaco (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Jaco]], [[Snowflake (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Snowflake]], and [[Pax (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Pax]], but hesitates when she sees Sarge. Sarge's team pushes May through the portal before closing it. Investigating Tinker, Benson decrypts a memory chip on him and finds footage of Sarge and his crew witnessing the destruction of a planet. In space, Fitz is out of cryo and on a cargo ship with Enoch, who helped him pass as being from the same planet as the crew. Their lie is discovered by the ship's controller, [[Viro (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Viro]], who threatens to kill them unless they work as slaves. Fitz tricks Viro into being sucked out of an airlock and changes course to Kitson, where the ship's crew can find new work.
| LineColor       = 25427D
}}
